flowchart LR
    REQ[Internet request] --> ALB[ALB\nAWS WAF associated]
    ALB -->|allowed| APP[Status-Page on EKS]

    ALB -->|BlockedRequests metric| CW[CloudWatch Alarm]
    CW --> EB[EventBridge]
    EB --> SQS[SQS security-events]
    SQS -. maxReceiveCount exceeded .-> DLQ[Dead-letter queue]

    SQS --> ANALYZER[AEGIS Analyzer Pod\nPod Identity]
    ANALYZER --> ENRICH[WAF event enrichment]
    ENRICH --> BEDROCK[Amazon Bedrock\nNova Pro]
    BEDROCK --> VALIDATE[JSON parse +\nschema / semantic validation]
    VALIDATE --> DDB[(DynamoDB findings\nconditional PutItem)]

    DDB --> REVIEW[Staff analyst review]
    REVIEW --> VERDICT[CORRECT / INCORRECT\nconditional update]
    VERDICT --> QUALITY[AEGIS/AIQuality\nCloudWatch metrics]

    DDB -. persistence succeeds .-> ACK[SQS ACK / delete]
    ACK -. completes .-> SQS

    UNTRUSTED[Telemetry and model output\nare untrusted data]
    UNTRUSTED -. trust boundary .-> ANALYZER
